::  modules/comlink/vantage/glow/fold-vantage-carry.glow -- Carry twin
/!  16384
|%
++  select-carry-posture
  |=  shortest-dp=@ud                                   ::  viewport min dp
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  0=desk,1=tab,2=mob
  ?:  (gte shortest-dp 960)  0                          ::  Vantage Station
  ?:  (gte shortest-dp 600)  1                          ::  Carry Tablet DC-1
  2                                                     ::  Carry Mobile Deck
++  gate-palm-accept
  |=  radius-px=@ud                                     ::  contact radius
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  0=accept, 1=palm
  ?:  (lte radius-px 28)  0  1                          ::  28px palm gate
--
